// RAG answer-quality eval cases (spec 0012, ADR-0021). Golden values are derived from
// samples/manifest.json (the answer key). `expectedSources` are the curated samples/leases/*.pdf
// file names whose chunks should be cited (recall@k matches them against Citation.Source).
// Comments + trailing commas are allowed: EvalDataset.Parse skips comments / allows trailing commas.
//
// Conventions:
//   - The corpus is type-DIVERSE (a few of each instrument kind), so cases exercise lookups across
//     oil & gas leases, memoranda, mineral/royalty/warranty/quitclaim deeds, surface-use & easement
//     agreements, title opinions, grazing leases, amendments, division orders, affidavits, probate
//     orders, assignments, JOAs, farmouts, AMIs, pooling orders, releases, ratifications, and AFEs.
//   - Multi-document cases list every source whose chunks should appear (cross-linked sample sets).
//   - "absent-*" cases ask something NOT in the corpus; expectedAnswer is the system's abstain string
//     and the recall sentinel source is ignored by the runner (recall is vacuous for absent cases).
[
  // ---- Oil & gas leases: single-document field lookups ----
